  displayName: Fire Station
  description: 'A red-brick fire station and its steam pumper, with a hose-drying
    tower. <color=#fc8>Protects 12 tiles round it from fire</color>: its crew put
    fires out and slow them spreading. <color=#9cf>Clean water</color>: sickness
    is less likely within 10 tiles, and does less harm there.'
